* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_uccf (reference/crafted.toml, 17 Nov 2026): demo12_capcom (commodity
* flows tied to the investment, decommissioning and lifetime of capacity) plus user constraints on
* those flows (UC_ATTR CAPFLO, so UC_CAPFLO: ppmain.mod L660-661, L1189), which give the term of
* uc_flo.mod L50-59 with cal_caps.mod; M1.3 change 58:
* - UCF_EACH, in both regions and each period, bounds the gas plant ELCTNGAS01's capacity-related
*   ELCCO2 and diesel; in REG2 with the attribute PERIOD (a factor FPD);
* - UCF_COST, in REG1, bounds the cost of the diesel tied to its investment (attribute COST: the
*   FLO_COST of demo12_capflo).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET UC_N
/
UCF_EACH 'Crafted: capacity-related flows of the new gas plant (TIMES.jl demo12_uccf)'
UCF_COST 'Crafted: cost of the diesel tied to the gas plant investment (TIMES.jl demo12_uccf)'
/

SET UC_R_EACH
/
REG1.UCF_EACH
REG2.UCF_EACH
REG1.UCF_COST
/

SET UC_ATTR
/
REG1.UCF_EACH.LHS.FLO.CAPFLO
REG2.UCF_EACH.LHS.FLO.CAPFLO
REG2.UCF_EACH.LHS.FLO.PERIOD
REG1.UCF_COST.LHS.FLO.CAPFLO
REG1.UCF_COST.LHS.FLO.COST
/

PARAMETER
UC_FLO ' '/
UCF_EACH.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELCCO2.ANNUAL 1
UCF_EACH.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL.ANNUAL 0.5
UCF_EACH.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.ELCCO2.ANNUAL 1
UCF_EACH.LHS.REG2.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL.ANNUAL 2
UCF_COST.LHS.REG1.2005.ELCTNGAS01.DSL.ANNUAL 1
/

PARAMETER
UC_RHSRT ' '/
REG1.UCF_EACH.2020.UP 3
REG1.UCF_EACH.2030.UP 4
REG2.UCF_EACH.2030.UP 20
REG1.UCF_COST.2015.UP 10
/
